Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,The Lion’s Dream
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, after the little goats defeated Team Rats,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey continues to drill the fundamentals as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky wants to learn cooler basketball skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So he trained alone, but unexpectedly ran into the popular idol Lion Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky was completely impressed by Lion Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did he know, Lion Jay would be their next opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We already finished our 100 laps, Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.80,0:01:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He leaves right after practice these past few days. I don’t know what he’s up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care what he’s doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to do anything anymore. I just want to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,your task tomorrow is to scout Team Lion Heart’s training session.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Know your enemy, know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No training tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m just curious why you’re willing to teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else looks down on us Goat Clan, thinking we’re too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I admire anyone who genuinely loves basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:01:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, will you teach me how to dunk today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you’re learning how to post up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don’t want to learn that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to learn how to dunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your height and build. Playing in the post is exactly what you need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Master the fundamentals first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to learn to walk before you can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you sound just like my coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.20,0:02:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to use your body to seal off and pressure the defender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,While you’re applying force, you must keep your center of gravity stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you’ve backed down your defender and generated enough space,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,you can choose your go-to move to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s how you post up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,—Lion Jay!　—So many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,—Lion Jay!　—Stay close to me, don’t get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be great if Sparky came too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s strong, so he could squeeze a path for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,—Lion Jay!　—Sparky has been acting all mysterious lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what he’s doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t push!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The fans are so passionate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get one last photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This wraps up today’s fan meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please exit in an orderly fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you everyone for coming out to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,See you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we’re not fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Team Defenders, your next opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Lion Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grassland’s best-selling magazine wants to interview you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s Lion Jay? Why has he gone missing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and find him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to dunk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t I tell you to master the fundamentals first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing a dunk like that easily leads to injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You look exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve had way too much on my plate these past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:04:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I went to practice at night, so I’ve got these bags under my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to do those events, you can just tell your agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to listen to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my agent is my benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, we will play basketball on a bigger stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was amazing! You’re a born star!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m a basketball idol agent. Do you want to play real basketball?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been scouting you guys for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your basketball skills are absolutely beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get you onto a pro court and make you a basketball idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to style!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If this keeps up, we’re gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Image comes first, winning comes second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys should feed the ball to Lion Jay more. Make sure he gets to dunk and score.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought being an idol would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you just leave the agent and quit the idol life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s the one who gave me the chance to play on a real court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to be ungrateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we’ll do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime later…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you’re nice with it. Let’s have a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You check up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out you’re all hype and no skill. You fold so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t deserve to be on the court at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s fine, as long as you have a good image.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me another cool pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I’ll prove my game isn’t just all hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.32,0:09:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} qualified to stand on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, looking cool isn’t what matters on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fundamentals are everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you put in the work, dunking will be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, today I’ll teach you the most critical skill for a power forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The most critical skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:09:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s about grabbing rebounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The key to rebounding
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is anticipating where the ball will land after bouncing off the rim,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and getting a step ahead of everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you get inside position to grab the board,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,clean up missed shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and create second-chance opportunities for your teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That is rebounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who controls the rebound dominates the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get to it! Basketball is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky has been disappearing lately. What has he been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Lion Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay is just like Sparky,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,always slipping away by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, the Grassland’s best-selling magazine wants to interview you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, Lion Jay won’t even have time to practice basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you goat again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you’re a scrub, don’t drag others down with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to practice, go work out on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I’ll head back with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t hang out with these weaklings anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If reporters photograph you, it will ruin your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We, the Goat Clan, are not weak at all! I challenge you to a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we win the next game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to let Lion Jay play real basketball
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and stop forcing him to be an idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you guys get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been here. We heard everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t look down on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t cregret it when you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning or losing doesn’t matter. Let’s go.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
